<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Ai on aLong</title><link>https://blog.51ai.vip/tags/ai/</link><description>Recent content in Ai on aLong</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://blog.51ai.vip/tags/ai/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>用 herdr pane layout 搭建并行编码工作流</title><link>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/%E7%94%A8-herdr-pane-layout-%E6%90%AD%E5%BB%BA%E5%B9%B6%E8%A1%8C%E7%BC%96%E7%A0%81%E5%B7%A5%E4%BD%9C%E6%B5%81/</link><pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/%E7%94%A8-herdr-pane-layout-%E6%90%AD%E5%BB%BA%E5%B9%B6%E8%A1%8C%E7%BC%96%E7%A0%81%E5%B7%A5%E4%BD%9C%E6%B5%81/</guid><description>如何用 herdr 的 pane layout 把多个 AI 编码 agent 放进同一台终端，让实现、调试、review 并行进行，而不是排队等待。 &lt;a href="https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/%E7%94%A8-herdr-pane-layout-%E6%90%AD%E5%BB%BA%E5%B9%B6%E8%A1%8C%E7%BC%96%E7%A0%81%E5%B7%A5%E4%BD%9C%E6%B5%81/"&gt;阅读全文 →&lt;/a&gt;</description></item><item><title>Pi agent 功能调试记录</title><link>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/pi-agent-%E5%8A%9F%E8%83%BD%E8%B0%83%E8%AF%95%E8%AE%B0%E5%BD%95/</link><pubDate>Wed, 05 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/pi-agent-%E5%8A%9F%E8%83%BD%E8%B0%83%E8%AF%95%E8%AE%B0%E5%BD%95/</guid><description>记录 Pi agent 中删除保护、小鱼（zen）、状态栏和 hjob 任务管理等功能的调试过程与实现结果。 &lt;a href="https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/pi-agent-%E5%8A%9F%E8%83%BD%E8%B0%83%E8%AF%95%E8%AE%B0%E5%BD%95/"&gt;阅读全文 →&lt;/a&gt;</description></item><item><title>Skillcaddy：统一管理 AI Agent Skill 的轻量方案</title><link>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/skillcaddy-unified-skill-asset-manager/</link><pubDate>Tue, 30 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/skillcaddy-unified-skill-asset-manager/</guid><description>在多 Agent 协作场景下，全局装 skill 会膨胀上下文、项目间拷贝又难同步版本。Skillcaddy 用「中央仓库 + 按需软链」的思路，把 skill 抽离到项目级管理，同时保持单一来源。 &lt;a href="https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/skillcaddy-unified-skill-asset-manager/"&gt;阅读全文 →&lt;/a&gt;</description></item><item><title>iFlow将command转换成skill</title><link>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/iflow%E5%B0%86command%E8%BD%AC%E6%8D%A2%E6%88%90skill/</link><pubDate>Wed, 07 Jan 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/iflow%E5%B0%86command%E8%BD%AC%E6%8D%A2%E6%88%90skill/</guid><description>之前帖子 提到通过iflow编写mdt指令。 我懒得通过指令去执了，所以让模型自己执行skill更舒服。 &lt;a href="https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/iflow%E5%B0%86command%E8%BD%AC%E6%8D%A2%E6%88%90skill/"&gt;阅读全文 →&lt;/a&gt;</description></item><item><title>Iflow通过hooks增加提醒</title><link>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/iflow%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87hooks%E5%A2%9E%E5%8A%A0%E6%8F%90%E9%86%92/</link><pubDate>Thu, 04 Dec 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/iflow%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87hooks%E5%A2%9E%E5%8A%A0%E6%8F%90%E9%86%92/</guid><description>使用iflow cli 时当我们下发一个任务或对话时在等待响应时，可能抽空做点别的事情。如果忘记了查看结果，那可能错过很久才想起来。 &lt;a href="https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/iflow%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87hooks%E5%A2%9E%E5%8A%A0%E6%8F%90%E9%86%92/"&gt;阅读全文 →&lt;/a&gt;</description></item><item><title>Raycast新版AI功能Custom Providers体验</title><link>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/raycast%E6%96%B0%E7%89%88ai%E5%8A%9F%E8%83%BD%E4%BD%93%E9%AA%8C/</link><pubDate>Thu, 31 Jul 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/raycast%E6%96%B0%E7%89%88ai%E5%8A%9F%E8%83%BD%E4%BD%93%E9%AA%8C/</guid><description>之前使用第三方的转发体验了三方API的接入。现在最新版支持Custom Providers 功能了。 &lt;a href="https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/raycast%E6%96%B0%E7%89%88ai%E5%8A%9F%E8%83%BD%E4%BD%93%E9%AA%8C/"&gt;阅读全文 →&lt;/a&gt;</description></item><item><title>Fellou浏览器体验记录</title><link>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/fellou%E6%B5%8F%E8%A7%88%E5%99%A8%E4%BD%93%E9%AA%8C%E8%AE%B0%E5%BD%95/</link><pubDate>Mon, 16 Jun 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/fellou%E6%B5%8F%E8%A7%88%E5%99%A8%E4%BD%93%E9%AA%8C%E8%AE%B0%E5%BD%95/</guid><description>上一篇水文写了Dia浏览器的体验，佬友问我是否可以使用Fellou浏览器。我开始不知道他是什么。 佬友私信给我一个邀请码，我注册了账号，体验了一下，感觉还不错。所以我记录一下体验。在此感谢佬友分享🫰。 &lt;a href="https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/fellou%E6%B5%8F%E8%A7%88%E5%99%A8%E4%BD%93%E9%AA%8C%E8%AE%B0%E5%BD%95/"&gt;阅读全文 →&lt;/a&gt;</description></item><item><title>Dia浏览器体验记录</title><link>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/dia%E6%B5%8F%E8%A7%88%E5%99%A8%E4%BD%93%E9%AA%8C%E8%AE%B0%E5%BD%95/</link><pubDate>Fri, 13 Jun 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/dia%E6%B5%8F%E8%A7%88%E5%99%A8%E4%BD%93%E9%AA%8C%E8%AE%B0%E5%BD%95/</guid><description>早在论坛拿到邀请🐎，下载打开一看，这啥啊这事？ 这么简约？ &lt;a href="https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/dia%E6%B5%8F%E8%A7%88%E5%99%A8%E4%BD%93%E9%AA%8C%E8%AE%B0%E5%BD%95/"&gt;阅读全文 →&lt;/a&gt;</description></item><item><title>RaycastAI Proxy</title><link>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/raycastai-proxy/</link><pubDate>Wed, 11 Jun 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/raycastai-proxy/</guid><description>一直在重度使用Raycast，AI方面之前一直使用chatGPT插件但是他有个缺点，不能继续对话。 &lt;a href="https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/raycastai-proxy/"&gt;阅读全文 →&lt;/a&gt;</description></item><item><title>Gemini制作AppleScritp一次过</title><link>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/gemini%E5%88%B6%E4%BD%9Capplescritp%E4%B8%80%E6%AC%A1%E8%BF%87/</link><pubDate>Tue, 20 May 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/gemini%E5%88%B6%E4%BD%9Capplescritp%E4%B8%80%E6%AC%A1%E8%BF%87/</guid><description>我喜欢使用Arc浏览器，自从同厂出的Dia出来后体验AI部分功能不错。但用它当作主力还是有点Chrome的感觉。我还是喜欢使用Arc，我想能否使用插件或者脚本来实现这个功能呢。没写过插件、脚本我问了大模型告诉我 open -a &amp;#34;Dia&amp;#34; &amp;#34;https://example.com&amp;#34; 能实现我的想法💡… &lt;a href="https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/gemini%E5%88%B6%E4%BD%9Capplescritp%E4%B8%80%E6%AC%A1%E8%BF%87/"&gt;阅读全文 →&lt;/a&gt;</description></item><item><title>通过gitlog用AI整理项目记录</title><link>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87gitlog%E7%94%A8ai%E6%95%B4%E7%90%86%E9%A1%B9%E7%9B%AE%E8%AE%B0%E5%BD%95/</link><pubDate>Wed, 19 Feb 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87gitlog%E7%94%A8ai%E6%95%B4%E7%90%86%E9%A1%B9%E7%9B%AE%E8%AE%B0%E5%BD%95/</guid><description>导出2024全年内容到文本： git log --since=&amp;#34;2024-01-01&amp;#34; --until=&amp;#34;2024-12-30&amp;#34; --pretty=format:&amp;#34;%h - %an, %ad : %s&amp;#34; --date=iso &amp;gt; commits2024.txt &lt;a href="https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87gitlog%E7%94%A8ai%E6%95%B4%E7%90%86%E9%A1%B9%E7%9B%AE%E8%AE%B0%E5%BD%95/"&gt;阅读全文 →&lt;/a&gt;</description></item><item><title>观《李继刚：当我们说「提示词」时，到底在说什么？》所感</title><link>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/%E8%A7%82%E6%9D%8E%E7%BB%A7%E5%88%9A%E5%BD%93%E6%88%91%E4%BB%AC%E8%AF%B4%E6%8F%90%E7%A4%BA%E8%AF%8D%E6%97%B6%E5%88%B0%E5%BA%95%E5%9C%A8%E8%AF%B4%E4%BB%80%E4%B9%88%E6%89%80%E6%84%9F/</link><pubDate>Tue, 31 Dec 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/%E8%A7%82%E6%9D%8E%E7%BB%A7%E5%88%9A%E5%BD%93%E6%88%91%E4%BB%AC%E8%AF%B4%E6%8F%90%E7%A4%BA%E8%AF%8D%E6%97%B6%E5%88%B0%E5%BA%95%E5%9C%A8%E8%AF%B4%E4%BB%80%E4%B9%88%E6%89%80%E6%84%9F/</guid><description>文中看到一两句觉得不错的话: &lt;a href="https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/%E8%A7%82%E6%9D%8E%E7%BB%A7%E5%88%9A%E5%BD%93%E6%88%91%E4%BB%AC%E8%AF%B4%E6%8F%90%E7%A4%BA%E8%AF%8D%E6%97%B6%E5%88%B0%E5%BA%95%E5%9C%A8%E8%AF%B4%E4%BB%80%E4%B9%88%E6%89%80%E6%84%9F/"&gt;阅读全文 →&lt;/a&gt;</description></item><item><title>LLM_fine Tuning</title><link>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/llm_fine-tuning/</link><pubDate>Thu, 15 Aug 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/llm_fine-tuning/</guid><description>微调是一种监督学习过程,在这个过程中可以使用一组带标签的示例数据来更新LLM的权重.使其为特定任务生成良好完成的能力. &lt;a href="https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/llm_fine-tuning/"&gt;阅读全文 →&lt;/a&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>